            </note>
            <note corresp="#d451-f2" n="1" xml:id="d451-f2-content">
                <p>The meeting was held from 11:55 a.m. to 12:25 p.m. (Kennedy Library, President’s
                    Appointment Book) For another record of this meeting, see <ref
                        target="frus1961-63v24#pg_846">vol. XXIV, pp. 846</ref>–<ref
                        target="frus1961-63v24#pg_848">848</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
